    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1016">

                <pb facs="1129" n="1033" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1033"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr. Woodford.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic">February 17,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Spanish chargé has presented telegraphic message of condolence from His Majesty’s
                    Government. Convey deep appreciation of this tribute to the memory of the many
                    who perished in the destruction of the <hi rendition="#italic">Maine</hi>, and
                    of this manifestation of sympathy with the American people in their grief.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Day</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
